{"availability":"available","full":"yh2424/yh2424.github.io","name":"yh2424.github.io","description":"Research group page of ASDL at Hanyang University — optoelectronic device-to-system integration for AI/HPC interconnects.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":28,"created":"2020-01-19T20:10:21Z","updated":"2026-10-17T14:47:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://beautifuljekyll.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:16:54.105Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:16:54.105Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T06:16:54.105Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T18:43:26.759Z","stars":1,"forks":28},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:34:04.739Z","stars":1,"forks":28},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:37:36.197Z","stars":1,"forks":28},{"at":"2026-10-19T06:16:54.105Z","stars":1,"forks":28}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Photonic devices and advanced packaging for AI semiconductors, from materials to systems.","Hanyang University ERICA, School of Semiconductor Convergence Engineering PI: Prof. Younghyun Kim (김영현) · younghyunkim@hanyang.ac.kr","ASDL은 AI 반도체 광통신, Co-Packaged Optics(CPO), 집적광학을 연구합니다. 대표 연구는 유리 기판 위 실리콘 나이트라이드 플랫폼 SING(SiN-on-Glass)으로, 광 재배선층(Optical RDL), 광섬유·유리·PIC 사이의 광 결합, 모듈레이터와 스위치 같은 광소자를 하나의 패키지로 통합합니다. 이 밖에 Si PIC용 고속 광 모듈레이터(III-V/Si, SiGe, MRM), 차세대 메모리(FeFET, FeDRAM), 디스플레이 소자(QD-LED, micro-LED)를 연구합니다."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yh2424/yh2424.github.io/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"1b369f4c4f8e625f30f2b45ffe7b9c273046986e9f674bed199e5d355079d193","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T13:48:26.233Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T13:48:26.233Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Photonic devices and advanced packaging for AI semiconductors, from materials to systems.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yh2424/yh2424.github.io/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1b369f4c4f8e6